[REQ-ISO26262-EDGE-CASE-026]
UID: ISO26262-EDGE-CASE-026
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Alignment Fault Handling and Misaligned Memory Access

DESCRIPTION:
PowerPC e200 cores may generate alignment faults for misaligned memory accesses, but the exception handling may not be correctly implemented or the compiler may generate instructions that cause alignment faults at runtime.

