PPCInstrInfo.td defines prefetch instructions (DCBT, DCBTST, ICBT) at lines 1815-1846. Memory.inc shows cache invalidation sequences at lines 236-250. However, prefetch operations may not be properly synchronized with code modifications or cache invalidation, potentially causing execution of stale instructions.

